<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed on Friday as Dow slips.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed on Friday as Dow slips.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in Friday New York trade as the Dow fell 10.77.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company     Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$32	     +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$29 1/2	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$19 7/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$14 7/8	 -0 3/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$80 7/8	 -0 3/4 *</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  34		  nil</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  191 1/2	   -0 1/2</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  255		 +6 1/2</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  153		 +3 1/4</p>
<p>Templeton	London  152 3/4	   +2 3/4</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.30	    -6</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.60	    nil</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$2.65	    -10</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.  </p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
